.env

# Data store: raw downloads, staging, processed parquet, features and the DuckDB
# file are NOT versioned (they can be large and are fully reproducible from the
# ingestion pipeline). Only manifests are kept so provenance survives a clone.
data/raw/
data/staging/
data/processed/
data/features/
data/*.duckdb
data/*.duckdb.wal
data/manifests/runs/
